 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Contractual Recreation — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have learned how to manipulate your materializations using your mind. You can manipulate objects or vehicles as a bonus action by spending 3 cursed energy per object or vehicle manipulated. Anything you use this on disappears afterwards.<br />\n<strong>Objects</strong>. You can manipulate a number of objects you have summoned telepathically. You can move them in the air up to 60 ft, and can use them normally from afar.<br />\n<strong>Weapon</strong>. Once per turn when you take the attack action, you can replace one of your attacks with a melee cursed energy attack roll with said object if it was a weapon. On a hit, it deals 5 of the weapon's damage dice. This increases to 7 dice at 15th level and 10 at 18th level.<br />\n<strong>Vehicles</strong>. You can order a vehicle to ride up to 60 ft. A creature in the path must make a Dexterity save or take the vehicle damage dice (depending on size) and be knocked prone.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
